<title>INDIA: SOCCER-IRAQ BEAT INDIA ON PENALTIES IN NEHRU GOLD CUP SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-IRAQ BEAT INDIA ON PENALTIES IN NEHRU GOLD CUP SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal result in the Nehru Gold Cup soccer tournament on Thursday;</p>
<p>Iraq 1 India 1 - after extra time</p>
<p>Halftime: 0-1. 90 mins: 1-1</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Iraq - Sadiq Abdul Ridha 74</p>
<p>India - Carlton Chapman 29</p>
<p>Iraq won 4-2 on penalties and meet Uzbekistan in the final on Saturday.</p>
</text>
